; A Signal that names an open enum in its fifth section: Model, whose variants
; are data added while the system runs, each carrying nothing or one of the
; types this file declares, here TripleEffort and QuadrupleEffort.
Signal
[]
[ Launch.Model
  Stop.Model ]
[ Launched
  Refused.String ]
[ TripleEffort.[ Low Medium High ]
  QuadrupleEffort.[ Low Medium High Maximum ] ]
[ Model ]
